    {
        "content": "<p>The problem here is <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/9846\">lean4#9846</a>. There doesn't seem to be a fix in sight so your best bet is probably to just write <code>if h : xs = #[] then ... else ...</code> instead (which will also just do a size check).</p>",
        "id": 597420892,
