        "timestamp": 1779647807
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The issue reads like the code in the example isn't idiomatic, am I correct? It's my code I'm trying to prove stuff about, so I could also change the code itself. I suppose doing an <code>if xs = #[]</code> or <code>if xs.size == 0</code> would be better?</p>",
        "id": 597421263,
